on_note":"本誌明名或親屬稱；跨篇辨識另記，未核原拓。"},{"id":"c-epitaph-yuanzhan-nmh-full:p001:m0112","start":112,"end":114,"surface":"士深","kind":"person","person_id":"ale_lqi_2nm_AA","status":"source_explicit","interpretation_note":"本誌明名或親屬稱；跨篇辨識另記，未核原拓。"},{"id":"c-epitaph-yuanzhan-nmh-full:p001:m0379","start":379,"end":380,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"ale_lqi_2nm_AA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"完整單方題銘／公諱湛後的誌主稱；不據題署倒推授爵日。"},{"id":"c-epitaph-yuanzhan-nmh-full:p001:m0394","start":394,"end":396,"surface":"務伯","kind":"person","person_id":"56f_8f7_e9f_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"本碑轉給事黃門侍郎後，以務伯矜嚴相擬；三國志杜恕完整本傳明恕字務伯、散騎黃門侍郎。字與同官語境支持有資格首選；矜嚴精確同語只見類聚引三輔決錄的搜尋線索，未親讀原典，不作本批主證。","reference_role":"historical_allusion"},{"id":"c-epitaph-yuanzhan-nmh-full:p001:m0401","start":401,"end":403,"surface":"昭先","kind":"person","person_id":"315_3d4_416_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"王昶書原文任昭先，裴注緊接昭先名嘏、完整別傳敘黃門侍郎與帝嘉其淑慎；本碑同黃門官語境的昭先淑慎相擬。此證是裴注所引別傳，未冒親讀失傳別傳。","reference_role":"historical_allusion"},{"id":"c-epitaph-yuanzhan-nmh-full:p001:m0618","start":618,"end":619,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"ale_lqi_2nm_AA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"完整單方題銘／公諱湛後的誌主稱；不據題署倒推授爵日。"},{"id":"c-epitaph-yuanzhan-nmh-full:p001:m0755","start":755,"end":756,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"ale_lqi_2nm_AA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"完整單方題銘／公諱湛後的誌主稱；不據題署倒推授爵日。"},{"id":"c-epitaph-yuanzhan-nmh-full:p001:m0781","start":781,"end":783,"surface":"伯始","kind":"person","person_id":"40b_0d5_c51","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"後漢書完整胡廣傳明字伯始、性溫柔謹素及天下中庸有胡公，與碑伯始溫柔、天下中庸連續對應；重用晉書漢太傅胡廣的既有來源端點。","reference_role":"historical_allusion"},{"id":"c-epitaph-yuanzhan-nmh-full:p001:m0786","start":786,"end":788,"surface":"子魚","kind":"person","person_id":"7zi_5gs_mq2","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"固定三國志十三完整華歆傳明字子魚，議論持平與清靜不煩等語境；碑在公輔議論以子魚和理相擬。不是一般同字猜人，也不把人物品評當湛實際性格。","reference_role":"historical_allusion"},{"id":"c-epitaph-yuanzhan-nmh-full:p001:m0873","start":873,"end":875,"surface":"天子","kind":"person","person_id":"pxb_ehb_qd4","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"魏書十二傳首明孝静皇帝諱善見、即位與車駕遷鄴；同紀武定元二年完整年度承同一紀主，二年五月丁酉明太尉廣陽王湛薨，與碑武定二年五月十四日丁酉薨鄴同事件。故本處天子舉哀首選在位孝靜帝，非齊獻武王或紀中後朝今上。","reference_role":"contemporaneous_sovereign"},{"id":"c-epitaph-yuanzhan-nmh-full:p001:m0898","start":898,"end":899,"surface":"公","kind":"person","person_id":"ale_lqi_2nm_AA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"完整單方題銘／公諱湛後的誌主稱；不據題署倒推授爵日。"},{"id":"c-epitaph-yuanzhan-nmh-full:p001:m1104","start":1104,"end":1106,"surface":"奉孝","kind":"person","person_id":"344_68f_98e","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"完整郭嘉本傳字奉孝；裴注傅子明引太祖哀哉奉孝痛哉奉孝惜哉奉孝，本碑哀哉奉孝乃悲逝者是同語弔典。保持傅子由裴注轉引層，不冒親讀傅子。","reference_role":"historical_allusion"},{"id":"c-epitaph-yuanzhan-nmh-full:p001:m1114","start":1114,"end":1116,"surface":"征虜","kind":"person","person_id":"i8i_z3v_rvq","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"後漢書祭遵完整單元明拜征虜將軍，卒後光武每歎安得憂國奉公之臣如祭征虜者乎；碑安得征虜實痛良臣對應同語弔典，非因同官稱而接馬援。","reference_role":"historical_allusion"},{"id":"c-epitaph-yuanzhan-nmh-full:p001:m1161","start":1161,"end":1162,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"ale_lqi_2nm_AA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"完整單方題銘／公諱湛後的誌主稱；不據題署倒推授爵日。"},{"id":"c-epitaph-yuanzhan-nmh-full:p001:m1266","start":1266,"end":1268,"surface":"惠王","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"詩頌王稱與篇首文獻王不同；保原字，待原拓／上下文校讀，未斷為另一人。"}],"annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"epitaph_as_modernly_transcribed","source_position":{"kind":"institutional_html_epitaph_transcription","source_text_start":0,"source_text_end":1474,"editorial_single_paragraph":true,"physical_line_divisions_inferred":false},"chapter_id":"c-epitaph-yuanzhan-nmh-full","book_id":"b-epitaph-yuanzhan-full","work_id":"w-epit